.TH XD\-SHELL 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-shell \- the XeonDesktop taskbar, Start menu and desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-shell
.OP \-\-style style
.OP \-\-scheme file
.OP \-\-taskbar\-only
.YS
.SY xd\-shell
.B \-\-toggle\-start\-menu
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-shell
puts a taskbar on every monitor, with the Start button, task buttons, Quick
Launch and the notification area (the clock, volume, network, Bluetooth,
battery and the Language bar, and StatusNotifierItem icons of other
programs), and draws the desktop's wallpaper and icons.
The Start menu is Windows 2000's, XP's or Windows 7's, as chosen in
Taskbar and Start Menu Properties
.RB ( xd\-taskbar (1));
its programs come from the installed desktop entries.
It also starts the screen saver after the configured wait.
.PP
.BR xd\-compositor (1)
starts it, passing on its own
.B \-\-style
and
.BR \-\-scheme ,
and restarts it if it crashes.
.PP
Under another wlroots compositor (sway, Hyprland, labwc...),
.B xd\-shell \-\-taskbar\-only
runs the taskbar on its own; or, if that compositor's session starts
.IR graphical\-session.target ,
.B systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now xeondesktop\-taskbar.service
starts it with the session.
Task buttons need the wlr-foreign-toplevel-management protocol and the
taskbar needs wlr-layer-shell.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-style " style"
The visual style
.RB ( classic ", " luna ", " whistler " or " aero )
instead of the one in
.IR desktop.ini .
.TP
.BI \-\-scheme " file"
A colour scheme
.RI ( .ini
file) instead of the one in
.IR desktop.ini .
.TP
.B \-\-taskbar\-only
Taskbars, Start menu and notification area, without the desktop
(wallpaper and icons): for another compositor's session.
.TP
.B \-\-toggle\-start\-menu
Open or close the running shell's Start menu, and exit; for another
compositor's key binding.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a summary of the options and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TERMINAL
The terminal for programs whose desktop entries say
.B Terminal=true
(default
.BR alacritty ).
.TP
.B XD_ICON_THEME
The icon theme used while Display Properties leaves Icons at Default
(default
.BR breeze ).
.TP
.B XD_SOUND_TRACE
A file to write the sounds that would play to instead of playing them
(for tests).
.TP
.B XD_CLOCK_FIXED
Text shown in place of the clock, which then never changes (for
screenshots and tests).
.TP
.B XD_SHELL_OPEN_MENU
Open the Start menu along this path at start-up, e.g.
.B Programs/Accessories
(for screenshots and tests).
.TP
.B XD_IDLE_SECONDS
Set to
.B 1
to count the screen saver's, monitor's and sleep timers in seconds
instead of minutes (for tests).
.TP
.B XD_TRAY_INACTIVE_SECONDS
How long a notification area icon stays quiet before it folds behind the
chevron, in seconds, instead of three minutes (for tests).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/xeondesktop/desktop.ini
The settings (default
.IR ~/.config/xeondesktop/desktop.ini );
changes are followed at once.
.TP
.I ~/.config/xeondesktop/start\-pinned
Programs pinned to the Windows 7 Start menu, one desktop file id a line.
.TP
.I ~/.config/xeondesktop/taskbar\-pinned
Programs pinned to the Windows 7 taskbar, one desktop file id a line.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/xeondesktop/quicklaunch/
The Quick Launch shortcuts: desktop entries or links to them, in file
name order.
.TP
.I ~/.face
The picture at the top of the XP and Windows 7 Start menus.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-compositor (1),
.BR xd\-taskbar (1),
.BR xd\-run (1),
.BR xd\-shutdown (1),
.BR xd\-lock (1)
